                </p>

                <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger rounded-pill fw-bold shadow-sm" onclick="ejecutarBorradoReal()">
                        Sí, Eliminar
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light rounded-pill text-muted fw-bold" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                        Cancelar
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
